config CMIS
	bool "CMIS pluggable optical module management decoding"
	help
	  Enable decoding of the Common Management Interface Specification
	  (CMIS) Page 00h used by high-speed pluggable transceivers such as
	  QSFP-DD, OSFP, SFP-DD and DSFP: the module-level monitors in Lower
	  Memory and the administrative information in Upper Page 00h.
